 "strings": {
  "I'll decide when it concerns me.": "",
  "Don't go digging up dirt.": "",
  "Don't go digging up dirt on old cases.": "",
  "Shintani went through a lot of\nwork making those charges go away.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei busted his ass\nto get that acquittal.": "",
  "You wanna keep playing detective,\nyou oughta work out more.": "",
  "If you wanna play hard-boiled detective,\nyou should work out more.": "",
  "Well I...": "",
  "Got jumped earlier.": "",
  "I got attacked earlier, too.": "",
  "By four assholes wearing ski masks.": "",
  "Four guys in ski masks...": "",
  "Yeah? And why should I care?": "",
  "And? So what?": "",
  "Well I think...\nMaybe you had something to do with it.": "",
  "Were they working for you?": "",
  "I'm pretty sure that's\nthe four of them right there.": "",
  "It was probably the four guys behind you.": "",
  "I think you must have\nmy boys confused.": "",
  "No idea what you're talking about.": "",
  "Right, Kengo?": "",
  "Right.": "",
  "No one likes a fuckin' liar!": "",
  "So don't gimme that bullshit!": "",
  "Kanae-chan quit. Packed her bags and\nwent back home. So stop looking for her.": "",
  "Kanae-chan quit, you know.\nShe's gone back home.": "",
  "Why?": "",
  "That so...?": "",
  "I'm gonna let you off with\na yellow card this time. ": "",
  "I'll let you off with a yellow card this time.": "",
  "But only 'cause the boss\nlikes you so much.": "",
  "Only 'cause the boss likes you so much.": "",
  "It's Yagami. You got a sec?": "",
  "It's Yagami.\nYou there, boss?": "",
  "Sure. Are you okay?": "",
  "Hey, you okay?": "",
  "You don't sound too good.": "",
  "Not feeling well?": "",
  "I could use a hand with\nthe family captain.": "",
  "Just your captain giving me a hard time.": "",
  "I'd really appreciate it if you\ncould get him off my case.": "",
  "I'd appreciate a little assistance with him.": "",
  "I see. Well, I'm just killing time at the office\nright now. Why don't you come on by? We'll talk.": "",
  "Ah, well, I'm down at the office.\nI'll wait for you here.": "",
  "Sounds good.": "",
  "I didn't think you'd try to pull that.\nRunning off and telling an adult. ": "",
  "Didn't think you'd do that.\nRun crying to the boss like a baby.": "",
  "Like a fucking child.": "",
  "That's pretty fucked up.": "",
  "Oh I just thought that...": "",
  "I just thought...": "",
  "The guy who actually runs the show would want\nto be able to keep tabs on his captain.": "",
  "...I probably oughta let the boss\nknow about this little spat of ours.": "",
  "He doesn't need to. So you keep your\ngoddamn nose out of this shit.": "",
  "You shouldn't have.\nAll you've gotta do is keep your head down.": "",
  "Understand?\nOr do I need to spell it out?": "",
  "Or is hearing it from me not good enough?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm hearing you\nloud and clear. So...": "",
  "No. I think I'm getting the picture.\nSooo...": "",
  "I guess we're done here.": "",
  "I guess we've got a deal.": "",
  "We're not done until I say so.": "",
  "I'm not finished yet!": "",
  "Words don't really work\non you, do they Tak?": "",
  "It takes more than a lecture\nto get through to you, Tak.": "",
  "Well, I guess you always\nhave been a fighter.": "",
  "You've been that way\nsince you were a kid.": "",
  "None of us thought you'd last a day in law school.\nBut you sure showed us. Went to night classes, passed the bar... ": "",
  "No matter how much everyone laughed,\nyou stuck with night classes until you passed the bar.": "",
  "You say you're done, but a guy\nwith balls like you doesn't give up.": "",
  "I bet that even now,\nyou don't wanna give up, right?": "",
  "You fought for your lawyer's badge,\nbut trash with a badge is still trash. ": "",
  "Ex-lawyer or not,\nyou grew up like the punk you are.": "",
  "And it's about time to take you out.": "",
  "Pain's the only way you'll ever learn.": "",
  "Ozaki.": "",
  "You should savor\nyour last sight.": "",
  "Here's how you lose your eyes.": "",
  "Let me go!": "",
  "...Stop it!": "",
  "Just kidding.": "",
  "Got ya.": "",
  "Hey, man! What the fuck do you\nthink you're doing?": "",
  "The fuck are you doing, dumbass!?": "",
  "Your ass ready to die? Huh?": "",
  "You wanna die now? Huh!?": "",
  "Enough of this...\nYou're dead!": "",
  "I'm done caring. Kill him!": "",
  "This is some bullshit.\nYou already went.": "",
  "This is bullshit.\nYou guys had your turn.": "",
  "What!?  ": "",
  "It's only fair I take my turn!": "",
  "It's my turn now!": "",
  "Steady now, Kengo.": "",
  "Don't miss now, Kengo.": "",
  "Aim for the heart.": "",
  "Yes, sir!": "",
  "Okay!": "",
  "If you're gonna shoot me,\nyou better do it yourself.": "",
  "You should pull the trigger yourself.": "",
  "Wait, how about the eyes?": "",
  "Actually, go between the eyes.": "",
  "One bullet in each.": "",
  "Take 'em both out.": "",
  "Man the fuck up, Kengo!": "",
  "Who the hell?": "",
  "Aren't you!?": "",
  "We gotta go.\nThis way!": "",
  "Let's roll! Follow me!": "",
  "Get them both!\nLet's go!": "",
  "Where you going!? Catch them!": "",
  "Get back here!": "",
  "Out with it.\nJust who are you?": "",
  "Hey, man...\nWho are you?": "",
  "I'd appreciate\na \"thank you\" first.": "",
  "Aren't you going to\nthank me this time?": "",
  "Why should I?\nAfter what you did to me this afternoon?": "",
  "After you stole my phone?": "",
  "I gave your phone back,\ndidn't I?": "",
  "But I gave it back.": "",
  "Then why even take it?\nWhat was the point of it?": "",
  "Why steal it, then?\nWhy give it back?": "",
  "I was trying to get away from a cop.\nAsshole just wouldn't get off my case.": "",
  "Those cops chasing me\nweren't giving up.": "",
  "But when I saw you on the phone,\nI had the greatest idea.": "",
  "Then I saw you on the phone,\nand a plan hit me.": "",
  "Okay, go on.": "",
  "A plan?": "",
  "Well...": "",
  "I guess the first step\nwas taking your phone.": "",
  "First I saw your phone, right?": "",
  "I knew you'd end up\nfollowing me after that.": "",
  "I figured you'd chase me\nif I snatched it.": "",
  "Then seeing you n' me running in the same\ndirection, the cop would think you were my buddy.": "",
  "If the cops saw you running the same way\nas me, they'd think you were one of us.": "",
  "And while he took his sweet time\narresting you, I was gonna escape.": "",
  "Then I'd have a clean getaway\nwhile you got arrested.": "",
  "I have to say, never thought you'd\nactually get away from him too, though.": "",
  "I didn't think you'd actually\nkeep up with me though...": "",
  "Eh, guess all's well that ends well.\nYeah?": "",
  "But all's well that ends well, right?": "",
  "And just now?\nWhy'd you come save me?": "",
  "And now?\nWhy'd you just save me?": "",
  "Good question.": "",
  "Because...　": "",
  "Why did I do it...?\nEh, beats me.": "",
  "Wait... Why <font_kind=yakuza_italic>did</font_kind> I do it?": "",
  "Heh. Interesting stuff.": "",
  "You're a weird dude.": "",
  "Hm. Let's just say I wanted to\napologize for stealing your phone.": "",
  "Guess I'm making up\nfor stealing your phone.": "",
  "Lucky break, huh? You'd have got your brains\nblown out if it wasn't for me.": "",
  "But I ended up saving your life,\nso you're pretty lucky, huh?": "",
  "You're telling me.": "",
  "So it seems.": "",
  "Guess I owe you.": "",
  "Thanks for the assist.": "",
  "In which case...\nWe're even now.": "",
  "There, we're even now.": "",
  "Hey.": "",
  "Why're you so dead set\non this burglary ring?": "",
  "Why run around committing theft?": "",
  "There's gotta be something better.": "",
  "You're wasting your youth on that crap.": "",
  "What?": "",
  "If you're looking for work...\nMaybe you could join us instead.": "",
  "If you're that bored...\nWhy not do some work for me?": "",
  "And have the yakuza out\nfor my head? Fat chance.": "",
  "Work that makes the yakuza\nwant you dead? Yeah right.": "",
  "Those guys from before\nwere Matsugane Family.": "",
  "Those guys were with the\nTojo Clan's Matsugane Family.": "",
  "But, uh...\nThe Kyorei's also looking for me.": "",
  "I'm butting heads with the\nKyorei Clan too, for that matter.": "",
  "You sure know how to sell it.": "",
  "You really do know how to sell it.": "",
  "But I don't think we can\ntrust each other just yet.": "",
  "I don't think we can trust\neach other quite yet, though.": "",
  "Yagami-san.": "",
  "...Yagami-san.  ": "",
  "What'd you say?\nHow do you know my name?": "",
  "Wait...\nHow do you know my name?": "",
  "A thief going after yakuza cash.\nCouldn't imagine anyone's that dumb.": "",
  "A thief robbing a yakuza's safe...": "",
  "But they did it.": "",
  "No one would even dare to think it.": "",
  "All under Kaito-san's watch.": "",
  "The guy on office duty that day,\nKaito-san, thought the same.": "",
  "The family lost 100 mil that day.": "",
  "100 million yen got stolen from that safe.": "",
  "But there was nothing Kaito-san\ncould do with a gun shoved in his face.": "",
  "Not even Kaito-san could stop it\nwith a gun shoved in his face.": "",
  "What the hell do you\nthink you're doing!?": "",
  "What the hell are you doing!?": "",
  "Making sure there's some\naccountability around here... Boss.": "",
  "Making sure someone\ntakes responsibility, boss.": "",
  "As if that'll suddenly make things right.\nHow exactly does this get our money back?": "",
  "As if a finger makes up for it.\nIs a finger going to bring my money back?": "",
  "Well, it won't.\nBut it's a start.": "",
  "No, but it's his fault all the same.": "",
  "It's important to set an example.": "",
  "We have to set an example here.": "",
  "A hundred mil, huh?": "",
  "Sooo...": "",
  "Sounds like that's\none expensive finger.": "",
  "That finger's worth 100 mil, huh?": "",
  "Tak. Why are you here?": "",
  "Tak... Why are you here?": "",
  "We were outside having a chat.": "",
  "He was already with me.": "",
  "The hell do you think you're doin'?": "",
  "What do you think you're doing!?": "",
  "That pinky's big money.": "",
  "A finger worth 100 mil?": "",
  "Thought I'd get a good long\nlook before it was gone forever.": "",
  "Thought I'd get a good look\nbefore it's gone.": "",
  "Shut it!": "",
  "Shut up!": "",
  "Heh. Pretty pathetic isn't it?": "",
  "Think this is funny, Tak?": "",
  "But Hamura.": "",
  "But, Cap...": "",
  "The damage was a hundred million.": "",
  "We're talking about 100 million.": "",
  "You really think one\npinky can cover that?": "",
  "Does one finger even cover that?": "",
  "Heh. There's gonna be a whole\nlot more comin' his way.": "",
  "We're just getting started, actually.": "",
  "More than this?": "",
  "Oh you are?": "",
  "Uhh... What more can you do?": "",
  "Then... there's worse?": "",
  "There is.": "",
  "Kaito-san...": "",
  "Kaito is...": "",
  "You're out... for good.": "",
  "...expelled as of today.": "",
  "There's no way.\nKaito-aniki is...": "",
  "No way. Kaito-aniki's getting...": "",
  "Boss. You're... okay with this?": "",
  "B-Boss... I...": "",
  "Begging him won't\nget you out of this.": "",
  "Crying isn't going to pay this tab.": "",
  "You see, Boss? It's gotta be done.\nYou know it's only fair.": "",
  "You see what we're doing,\nright, boss? This is mandatory.": "",
  "You should know...\nI already informed the main family of this.": "",
  "It's already gone up to the main family.": "",
  "Did you now?": "",
  "You told them?": "",
  "You were awfully efficient about that.": "",
  "You worked pretty fast, huh?": ""
 },
